---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="How Our London Handyman Service Works | Fettle" description="Four plain steps. No forms to wrestle, no salesy phone calls – just a first visit and honest work.">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h1>From your postcode to a tidy finish.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Four plain steps. No forms to wrestle, no salesy phone calls &ndash; just a first visit and honest work.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-body">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="grid two">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>01 &middot; Check the list</h3>
            <p>Give us your postcode. We take on a few more homes each season, so we&rsquo;ll tell you straight if there&rsquo;s room near you.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>02 &middot; First visit</h3>
            <p>The visit is &pound;30 &ndash; we come and take a proper look, note what needs doing, and get to know the house, from the stopcock to the floorboard that creaks.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>03 &middot; A plain price</h3>
            <p>Half-day or full-day, from &pound;140 &ndash; your &pound;30 visit fee counted in. No surprises. You&rsquo;ll know the cost before we lift a tool.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>04 &middot; The work, tidily done</h3>
            <p>Dust sheets down, shoes off, radio low. The same faces each visit, and everything left as it should be.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <div class="prose">
          <h2>Moving out? We do that too</h2>
          <p>Our <a href="/services/end-of-tenancy-cleaning">end of tenancy clean</a> covers the whole property, carpets included, plus the small repairs and touch-ups agents check for &ndash; with a free re-clean if anything is flagged within 48 hours. Studio from &pound;180. <a href="/services/carpet-cleaning">Carpet cleaning</a> on its own starts from &pound;45 a room.</p>

          <h2>Kept in order, not just fixed</h2>
          <p>Most of our homes stay with us. Once we know a house, the once-a-season look-over keeps small things from becoming big ones &ndash; and means the work you notice is only that everything simply works.</p>
          <p style="margin-top:8px"><a class="btn primary" href="/contact">Contact</a> &nbsp; <a class="btn secondary" href="/services">What we fix</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Page>
